r = {&quot;Hello, I would like to order a Pepperoni pizza.&quot;, &quot;I&apos;m going to have a Cheese pizza deliverd&quot;, &quot;I want a Sausage Pizza&quot;,&quot;I guess I will get a Mountain Dew&quot;}
